---

<ServiceLayout
  lang={lang}
  title="2D and 3D animation for brands | SEZMOO"
  description="2D/3D animation and motion design by SEZMOO: product cutaways, process explainers and ads that show what a camera cannot record. Gdańsk, Poland."
  canonical={canonical}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
<div class="sd">
<section class="sd__hero shell">
  <span class="sd__kick reveal"><i></i>Services</span>
  <h1 class="sd__h1 reveal">2D and 3D <span style="color:#ffd200">animation.</span></h1>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">Animation shows <b>what a camera cannot record</b> – a cutaway of a product, the flow of a process, data, or a concept that does not exist yet.</p>
  <p class="sd__lead reveal" data-d="1">We do motion design for ads and social media, 3D product and technical animation, and explainers that make an offer clear in under a minute.</p>
  <div class="sd__facts reveal" data-d="2">
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Scope</span><strong>Motion · 3D · explainer</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Format</span><strong>Ads, social, web</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Source</span><strong>3D model or artwork</strong></div>
    <div class="sd__fact"><span>Base</span><strong>Gdańsk · remote</strong></div>
  </div>
  <figure class="sd__reel reveal" data-d="1">
    <img src="/assets/optimized/lcp/vts-animacja-0c87eef9-800.webp" srcset="/assets/optimized/lcp/vts-animacja-0c87eef9-800.webp 800w" sizes="100vw" width="800" height="787" alt="VTS Group" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    <figcaption><b>VTS Group</b><span>3D animation / B2B content</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
<div class="sd__body shell">
  <div>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-zakres">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>What we animate</h2></div>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>2D animation &amp; motion design</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Advertising animation, cards, kinetic typography, transitions, bumpers and loops – also as a graphic layer inside films.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Advertising animation</span><span>Motion design</span><span>Kinetic typography</span><span>Bumper</span><span>Social loop</span><span>Animated logo</span><span>Graphics for film</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal" open><summary><h3>3D product animation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Product visualisation, cutaways, technical animation and presentations of things that cannot be filmed on set.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>3D product animation</span><span>Technical cutaway</span><span>Process visualisation</span><span>Product render</span><span>Machine animation</span><span>Solution walkthrough</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Explainer &amp; infographics</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Short animation that explains a process, an offer or data – for the website, sales decks and social media.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Explainer video</span><span>Animated infographic</span><span>Data visualisation</span><span>Process animation</span><span>Animation for decks</span></div></div></details>
      <details class="sd__g reveal"><summary><h3>Campaign animation</h3><span class="sd__pm"></span></summary><div class="sd__gin"><p>Motion creative built for media: vertical versions, cutdowns and format variants for Meta Ads, Google Ads and YouTube.</p><div class="sd__tags"><span>Video creative for Ads</span><span>Vertical versions</span><span>Cutdowns</span><span>Animated banners</span><span>YouTube animation</span></div></div></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-proces">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__steps">
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Concept</h3><p>We settle what the animation must explain and in what format.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Script and storyboard</h3><p>We map the flow, the copy and the key frames.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Artwork and 3D model</h3><p>We prepare assets, the model or the graphic layers.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Animation</h3><p>Movement, camera, pacing and rhythm tuned to the channel.</p></div>
        <div class="sd__step reveal"><h3>Sound and export</h3><p>Sound design, subtitles and versions for every format.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="sd__blk" id="sd-work">
      <div class="sd__blkh reveal"><h2>Selected work</h2></div>
      <div class="sd__work">
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/animacja-3d.jpg" alt="Baltic 3D" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Factory model · 3D animation</span><h3>Baltic 3D ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/audi-a6-etron.jpg" alt="Audi A6 e-tron" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Motion · Launch</span><h3>Audi A6 e-tron ↗</h3></a>
        <a class="sd__wi reveal" href="/realizacja-world-of-warships/"><div class="sd__wm"><img src="/assets/work/warships-container.avif" alt="World of Warships" loading="lazy" /></div><span>Event content · Motion</span><h3>World of Warships ↗</h3></a>
      </div>
      <div class="sd__more reveal">
        <a class="is-lead" href="/en/portfolio-en/#pt-grid">Full portfolio ↗</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=video#pt-grid">Video</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=animacje#pt-grid">Animation</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=eventy#pt-grid">Events</a>
        <a href="/en/portfolio-en/?cat=grafika#pt-grid">Graphics</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
</ServiceLayout>
